OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of people gather in
OL,4,Asupport of Drumcree Orangemen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have gathered in
OL,7,FPortadown to show support for the
OL,8,FOrange Order in the wake of the
OL,9,FDrumcree dispute.
OL,11,FHundreds of Orangemen are parading
OL,12,Fthrough the town centre, joined by
OL,13,Fbands and a crowd of supporters who
OL,14,Fhave not been deterred by the stormy
OL,15,Fweather.
OL,17,FThe parade comes amid continuing
OL,18,Ftensions surrounding the long-running
OL,19,FDrumcree dispute, whereby the Orange
OL,20,FOrder has been banned from walking down
OL,21,Fthe mainly nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,22,Fthe County Armagh town.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
